     "body": "<p>Tested using the Mac OS X OpenJDK 7 port<span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span>. Compiling worked, and when running under this VM, all tests passed except those involving the image manipulation service. I believe they failed because the Mac version of OpenJDK (as of build 1.7.0-b213-20111014) is currently missing a lot of the awt stuff.</p>\n\n<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;1&#93;</span> <a href=\"http://code.google.com/p/openjdk-osx-build/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://code.google.com/p/openjdk-osx-build/</a></p>",
     "created": "14/Oct/11 7:39 PM",
